WEBVTT

00:41.792 --> 00:45.963
MY ROYAL NEMESIS

00:51.760 --> 00:53.971
The caller you are trying
to reach is unavailable.

00:54.054 --> 00:56.181
You will be transferred to voicemail

00:56.265 --> 00:58.016
after the beep.

00:59.643 --> 01:01.144
Shin Seo-ri, I was wrong.

01:01.228 --> 01:03.397
It's all my fault.
Just pick up your phone.

01:04.898 --> 01:07.234
I'll wait here until you come home.

01:12.781 --> 01:16.410
JANGSUGOL PORK BACKBONE STEW

01:17.911 --> 01:19.079
-Shin Seo-ri.
-Step back.

01:19.162 --> 01:20.539
-Step back.
-Get out of my way.

01:20.622 --> 01:22.207
Let me through! I'm her guardian.

01:22.291 --> 01:23.667
Let go!

01:23.750 --> 01:24.835
Shin Seo-ri.

01:24.918 --> 01:26.628
Shin Seo-ri, wake up.

01:26.712 --> 01:28.046
Wake up, Shin Seo-ri!

01:30.173 --> 01:31.758
EMERGENCY MEDICAL CENTER

01:38.348 --> 01:40.267
-Please clear the way.
-Make way.

01:40.350 --> 01:42.102
-Please step back.
-Coming through!

01:42.185 --> 01:43.395
Coming through!

01:43.478 --> 01:45.272
CURRENT TIME 19:27
SURGICAL TIME, ANESTHESIA TIME

02:16.428 --> 02:17.971
Your Highness.

02:21.767 --> 02:24.728
Your Highness, are you awake?

02:24.811 --> 02:27.439
-Hurry. Go fetch the physician!
-Yes, ma'am!

02:30.984 --> 02:32.402
Your Highness?

02:32.486 --> 02:34.696
Your Highness, are you awake?

02:35.530 --> 02:36.615
Where am I…

02:36.698 --> 02:38.867
Do you recognize me?

02:43.622 --> 02:47.167
EPISODE 11
WHAT LIES ON THE HIDDEN PATH

02:51.797 --> 02:53.423
What are you doing here…

02:57.636 --> 02:58.720
What is wrong with her?

02:58.804 --> 03:01.098
Why can she not move
when she is clearly awake?

03:01.181 --> 03:03.975
Her blood flow and vital energy
have yet to be restored.

03:04.059 --> 03:06.937
Still, she has escaped the deathly trance.
Let us wait and see.

03:07.020 --> 03:07.938
Deathly trance?

03:08.021 --> 03:10.857
With breath restored,
once blood flow and vital energy return,

03:10.941 --> 03:12.067
she should be able to move.

03:12.150 --> 03:14.403
So are we to just wait indefinitely?

03:14.486 --> 03:16.863
It is truly a miracle
she has made it this far.

03:16.947 --> 03:19.282
Even if she was shielded
with the herbal antidote,

03:19.366 --> 03:21.243
-her organs were damaged by the poison…
-Poison?

03:21.326 --> 03:24.538
-…and have not fully healed.
-Have I truly returned?

03:24.621 --> 03:25.914
But what is wrong with my body…

03:25.997 --> 03:28.125
She is stable for now.

03:28.208 --> 03:31.211
I shall prepare the remainder
of the Chuhontang and calamus extract.

03:31.294 --> 03:33.171
All right. Make haste.

03:48.270 --> 03:50.731
Hey. Stop.

03:51.314 --> 03:52.607
Can you not hear my voice?

03:52.691 --> 03:53.900
Hey!

03:57.696 --> 03:58.989
Am I

03:59.072 --> 04:00.782
trapped

04:00.866 --> 04:02.284
in this body?

04:09.416 --> 04:11.585
A small bleed has caused
some swelling in the brain.

04:11.668 --> 04:14.880
Fortunately, medication was enough.
No surgery was needed.

04:14.963 --> 04:16.840
No serious external injuries
aside from bruising.

04:16.923 --> 04:18.133
So her life isn't in danger?

04:18.216 --> 04:20.552
That's right. As long as there are
no complications,

04:20.635 --> 04:22.888
she should regain consciousness
in a few days.

04:24.181 --> 04:26.558
The problem is Chairman Cha.

04:27.642 --> 04:28.518
Tell me.

04:28.602 --> 04:30.270
The surgery was successful,

04:30.353 --> 04:33.565
but we must monitor him
until his breathing stabilizes.

04:36.902 --> 04:39.613
This afternoon, Chail Group's
Chairman Cha Dal-su

04:39.696 --> 04:41.740
was critically injured
in a drunk driving accident

04:41.823 --> 04:42.949
involving a truck.

04:43.033 --> 04:44.075
-My goodness.
-The driver…

04:44.159 --> 04:46.495
had a blood alcohol level of 0.12%

04:46.578 --> 04:48.872
and was found to be heavily intoxicated.

04:49.748 --> 04:51.917
-Father.
-Father.

04:52.000 --> 04:54.085
What an absolute nightmare this is.

04:54.169 --> 04:56.129
Father. Our poor father.

04:57.255 --> 04:59.674
Se-gye, I heard you went straight
to the accident scene.

04:59.758 --> 05:01.092
How did you know to go there?

05:01.176 --> 05:02.761
-What do you mean?
-Well, think about it.

05:02.844 --> 05:05.222
The accident is strange,
as is how quickly you showed up.

05:05.305 --> 05:06.598
What are you trying to say?

05:06.681 --> 05:08.767
Stop it.

05:08.850 --> 05:10.602
Is this really the time for that?

05:10.685 --> 05:11.728
I'm just merely raising

05:11.812 --> 05:13.980
a reasonable suspicion.

05:14.064 --> 05:15.565
I mean, the logic just isn't there.

05:15.649 --> 05:18.360
A car crashing into a restaurant
in broad daylight

05:18.443 --> 05:21.446
isn't exactly something
you can easily wrap your head around.

05:27.702 --> 05:29.246
Is Grandfather okay?

05:29.329 --> 05:30.831
He just came out of surgery.

05:30.914 --> 05:33.792
The doctor said it went well,
so we must be patient.

05:36.127 --> 05:38.672
Se-gye, you don't look well at all.

05:38.755 --> 05:40.924
Do you want to step outside
for some fresh air?

05:41.007 --> 05:41.925
I'm fine.

05:45.136 --> 05:46.721
GRANDMOTHER OK-SUN

05:50.767 --> 05:52.602
Sorry to bother you.

05:52.686 --> 05:55.480
But I just can't seem to reach Seo-ri.

05:55.564 --> 05:57.148
Is everything okay in Seoul?

06:00.694 --> 06:01.820
Yes.

06:02.696 --> 06:04.281
Everything is fine.

06:04.364 --> 06:05.323
Don't worry.

06:05.407 --> 06:08.201
I'll take care of your restaurant too.

06:08.285 --> 06:10.537
So please don't worry about a thing.

06:10.620 --> 06:12.455
My goodness.

06:12.956 --> 06:16.084
Hearing you say that
is nice and reassuring,

06:16.167 --> 06:17.460
but please don't overdo it.

06:17.544 --> 06:20.589
It'd be nice if things went
the way you planned,

06:20.672 --> 06:23.758
but nothing comes easy in life.

06:25.552 --> 06:26.887
I'm plenty grateful as it is.

06:27.846 --> 06:29.806
Thanks to you, I can finally relax.

06:29.890 --> 06:32.183
I've always had this knot in my chest

06:32.267 --> 06:34.144
because I was worried
she'd wither away alone.

06:34.227 --> 06:36.396
Now I can finally breathe easy.

06:37.397 --> 06:40.567
My Seo-ri takes after me.
She can be a bit feisty.

06:40.650 --> 06:43.528
She just runs her mouth
without thinking sometimes.

06:43.612 --> 06:45.947
Even so, just say that it's lovely.

06:46.031 --> 06:48.909
When someone close to you
keeps calling you lovely,

06:48.992 --> 06:51.786
you really do become lovely.
It's human nature.

06:54.331 --> 06:55.206
All right.

06:57.667 --> 06:58.627
I will.

06:59.794 --> 07:01.463
I promise I will.

07:10.805 --> 07:11.973
Do not follow me.

07:12.057 --> 07:14.225
-I cannot stand the sight of you.
-As if.

07:15.352 --> 07:17.729
Your grandmother was right.

07:17.812 --> 07:19.981
You're feisty and difficult.

07:20.065 --> 07:22.651
You throw hurtful words around
without thinking.

07:23.276 --> 07:24.569
But what can I do?

07:25.362 --> 07:27.572
Even if you can't stand me,
we have no other choice.

07:27.656 --> 07:29.741
No matter how much you push me away,

07:29.824 --> 07:31.868
I'm going to stick right by your side.

07:50.845 --> 07:52.263
When I was a kid,

07:52.889 --> 07:54.641
I used to love the days

07:54.724 --> 07:57.352
I would hold my mom's hand
to go to your house.

07:57.435 --> 07:59.646
There was so much delicious food.

08:00.271 --> 08:01.439
The house was huge.

08:01.523 --> 08:05.151
I even thought it would be nice
if Mom and I lived there with you.

08:08.071 --> 08:10.240
Since you were alone anyway.

08:10.782 --> 08:13.910
I wished you were my father.

08:22.877 --> 08:24.337
When I gave you the transplant,

08:24.421 --> 08:27.424
I'd be lying if I said
I didn't have any ulterior motive.

08:28.508 --> 08:32.053
But it made me feel
like we became connected somehow.

08:32.137 --> 08:33.555
You and me.

08:33.638 --> 08:35.390
Even though I meant nothing to you.

08:38.143 --> 08:40.562
So what's your point?

08:40.645 --> 08:42.063
Did you really come here

08:42.147 --> 08:44.816
thinking that gave you
leverage over Se-gye?

08:44.899 --> 08:46.067
Some trifling brat?

08:46.151 --> 08:47.027
Because I know

08:47.110 --> 08:49.946
Jin-u still breaks your heart,
after all this time.

08:50.030 --> 08:52.198
I couldn't let Se-gye betray you as well.

08:54.200 --> 08:55.744
I shot myself in the foot.

08:55.827 --> 08:57.871
You had such wicked eyes, even as a boy.

08:57.954 --> 09:00.081
I knew this day would come.

09:00.915 --> 09:03.001
I couldn't refuse Hye-suk's request,

09:03.084 --> 09:05.336
and now I'm paying for it dearly.

09:08.214 --> 09:10.675
Why do you think
I've kept you by my side

09:10.759 --> 09:12.302
for all these years?

09:13.011 --> 09:15.013
You're nothing but a debt to me.

09:15.096 --> 09:19.225
A debt my only sister left behind
with our blood ties as collateral.

09:19.309 --> 09:20.268
And you dare

09:20.351 --> 09:22.645
disgrace my grandson?

09:23.354 --> 09:25.065
A lowly bastard like you!

09:26.941 --> 09:30.236
If I'm the debt you owe my mother,

09:31.112 --> 09:32.697
then that debt…

09:35.575 --> 09:37.827
You can start paying me back now.

09:38.453 --> 09:42.165
Be sure to include the interest
for my loyalty over the last 20 years.

09:50.173 --> 09:53.384
If you do, I'm willing
to show you some leniency,

09:54.219 --> 09:55.720
Uncle.

10:17.075 --> 10:17.951
RESEARCHER

10:20.870 --> 10:22.247
WHISTLEBLOWER CONFESSION:
BIOJEI…

10:23.581 --> 10:26.417
-Their image is completely ruined.
-Who would buy it now?

10:32.841 --> 10:33.925
Sir.

10:34.008 --> 10:34.884
The news…

10:34.968 --> 10:36.219
The news?

10:40.348 --> 10:42.892
Chail Group, a cornerstone
of Korea's corporate world,

10:42.976 --> 10:45.103
is facing a seismic shift
in its succession.

10:45.186 --> 10:47.021
A chain of setbacks has been hitting

10:47.105 --> 10:49.983
this top-ten conglomerate
in rapid succession,

10:50.066 --> 10:52.068
putting its future in jeopardy.

10:52.152 --> 10:53.695
Cha Se-gye of the Cha Family

10:53.778 --> 10:56.489
is under fire, and a major earnings miss

10:56.573 --> 10:59.075
has only fueled the controversy.

10:59.159 --> 11:03.705
The backlash is mounting
after carcinogenic substances

11:03.788 --> 11:07.041
were discovered in Dynaestie,
a new line from Cha's cosmetics startup,

11:07.125 --> 11:09.169
-Biojei.
-The rest to the CEO's office!

11:09.252 --> 11:12.672
Biojei was quick to dismiss
the claims as baseless,

11:12.755 --> 11:15.091
but whistleblower reports
of harmful substances

11:15.175 --> 11:17.385
in an upcoming product
have been pouring in.

11:17.468 --> 11:21.055
An online boycott of the brand
has spread like wildfire.

11:21.764 --> 11:24.601
A past power-abuse scandal resurfacing
amid everything else

11:24.684 --> 11:26.060
has sent their stock into freefall.

11:26.144 --> 11:27.645
In the fallout, Kaiserman Capital,

11:27.729 --> 11:29.689
Dynaestie's largest known investor,

11:29.772 --> 11:31.733
exercised its conversion rights

11:31.816 --> 11:34.444
to take the top shareholder
position at Biojei,

11:34.527 --> 11:37.363
positioning itself as a white knight.

11:37.447 --> 11:39.657
With Kaiserman
now participating in management,

11:39.741 --> 11:43.328
the business world is watching
to see if Biojei can bounce back.

11:43.411 --> 11:45.371
Meanwhile,
Chail Group Chairman Cha Dal-su

11:45.455 --> 11:48.416
has fallen into a coma
following a sudden accident.

11:48.499 --> 11:50.627
Management convened
an emergency shareholders' meeting

11:50.710 --> 11:52.545
in a bid to shore up
the falling stock price.

11:52.629 --> 11:55.215
At the meeting, Choi Mun-do,
Chairman Cha Dal-su's nephew

11:55.298 --> 11:58.051
and current president of Chail E&amp;C,

11:58.134 --> 12:00.720
was approved to take over
leadership of the group,

12:00.803 --> 12:03.806
with 69.3% in favor and 30.7% against.

12:03.890 --> 12:06.100
As Chail Group bypasses
third-generation succession

12:06.184 --> 12:07.769
in favor of a collateral line,

12:07.852 --> 12:10.230
industry watchers are closely following
whether this marks

12:10.313 --> 12:12.232
a new precedent
for chaebol succession in Korea.

12:12.315 --> 12:14.234
Then what happens to the owner's family?

12:14.317 --> 12:15.735
The daughters are figureheads,

12:15.818 --> 12:17.737
and the one grandson
got cut off at the knees.

12:17.820 --> 12:18.988
It's a lost cause.

12:19.072 --> 12:21.366
This is why you must align yourself
with the right people.

12:21.449 --> 12:22.825
Don't you think?

12:30.500 --> 12:32.669
This will be your desk.

12:32.752 --> 12:35.755
There's no handover,
so you can just start working right away.

12:35.838 --> 12:37.131
Yes, sir.

12:37.757 --> 12:39.968
Shouldn't you be packing up?

12:40.051 --> 12:41.344
Right.

12:43.763 --> 12:47.267
So you're telling me this was
all Choi Mun-do's master plan?

12:47.350 --> 12:49.727
Kaiserman Capital was the Trojan Horse.

12:49.811 --> 12:51.562
Director Jang was a spy.

12:51.646 --> 12:54.065
You know, I always got
a weird vibe from him.

12:54.607 --> 12:57.819
I thought you said he was a rare grown-up
among all the clueless Gen Zers.

12:57.902 --> 12:59.279
That was…

13:00.071 --> 13:03.116
To be fair, he is on the older side
for a cosmetics startup.

13:03.199 --> 13:04.325
Exactly,

13:04.409 --> 13:06.744
the boomer held it in well.

13:06.828 --> 13:08.162
A founding figure of Chail Group,

13:08.246 --> 13:10.915
but he was used and discarded
by Chairman Cha.

13:10.999 --> 13:13.918
He must have grabbed
President Choi Mun-do as a lifeline.

13:14.585 --> 13:16.421
It's fine. Just be patient.

13:16.504 --> 13:18.589
It never ends well for people
who act like Lü Bu.

13:18.673 --> 13:19.757
Just wait and see.

13:19.841 --> 13:21.092
If Director Jang is Lü Bu,

13:21.175 --> 13:23.303
what does that make President Choi Mun-do?

13:24.345 --> 13:25.638
Dong Zhuo?

13:26.681 --> 13:27.640
Isn't it obvious?

13:27.724 --> 13:29.517
He's Cao Cao.

13:29.600 --> 13:31.978
A ruthless poker face.

13:32.061 --> 13:34.814
Seo-jun, how is it being in Korea?

13:34.897 --> 13:36.065
Are you happy?

13:36.149 --> 13:37.317
Yes, I am.

13:38.484 --> 13:41.029
It would've been even better

13:41.112 --> 13:43.197
if my nanny could've come.

13:44.157 --> 13:45.116
She said

13:45.199 --> 13:47.327
she couldn't come
because she has her family over there.

13:47.410 --> 13:49.203
She wanted me to tell you
that she's sorry.

13:49.287 --> 13:51.497
If that's why, it's fine.

13:51.581 --> 13:53.207
Because I have a dad now too.

14:04.093 --> 14:06.387
Hey, what did the assistant director say?

14:06.471 --> 14:08.639
He said the shooting schedule
can't be adjusted, right?

14:08.723 --> 14:11.476
I asked him, but he was merciless.

14:11.559 --> 14:12.435
He said he can't upend

14:12.518 --> 14:14.354
the cast's schedule
over one supporting actor.

14:14.437 --> 14:17.315
It seems like there's even a chance
they might drop her.

14:20.735 --> 14:23.112
Gosh. Ji-hyo.

14:23.738 --> 14:26.824
Your shoot ended at dawn yesterday.
You should've just rested.

14:26.908 --> 14:29.744
She's an actor in the same agency
and the same drama.

14:29.827 --> 14:31.079
Imagine if I didn't come.

14:31.162 --> 14:33.915
They'll say I'm rotten to the core,
call me a complete diva,

14:33.998 --> 14:35.333
and drag me through the mud.

14:35.416 --> 14:37.877
Well, you're right about that.

14:37.960 --> 14:40.046
But since Seo-ri

14:40.129 --> 14:41.881
is unconscious right now,

14:41.964 --> 14:44.217
leaving this will be more than enough.

14:45.968 --> 14:48.346
She's unconscious?

15:03.194 --> 15:06.572
She looks fine on the outside,
so why is she still unconscious?

15:06.656 --> 15:08.032
I'm not sure.

15:08.116 --> 15:10.785
The doctor said she wasn't badly hurt,

15:11.285 --> 15:12.662
so I'm not really sure.

15:14.872 --> 15:17.250
Then she'll definitely miss
the shoot in two days.

15:17.333 --> 15:18.751
Fair grounds for firing.

15:18.835 --> 15:19.919
The whole cast and crew

15:20.002 --> 15:22.296
shouldn't have to take
a hit over one supporting actor.

15:22.380 --> 15:23.256
That's just too much.

15:23.339 --> 15:24.549
Even so,

15:24.632 --> 15:27.593
that's not something you say
to a colleague in the hospital.

15:29.637 --> 15:30.888
Mr. Baek Gwang-nam.

15:30.972 --> 15:32.265
You really sounded

15:32.348 --> 15:34.225
like her real manager just now.

15:35.685 --> 15:37.019
Sorry.

15:39.605 --> 15:41.065
Want to know something?

15:41.774 --> 15:43.985
Chances are, nobody's searched
Shin Seo-ri's name

15:44.068 --> 15:45.194
more than I have.

15:45.278 --> 15:46.362
I really hated

15:46.446 --> 15:48.114
Shin Seo-ri when we were child actors.

15:49.115 --> 15:49.991
You can have this.

15:50.074 --> 15:51.200
I have a lot left.

15:54.704 --> 15:56.664
Shin Seo-ri, quit showing off.

15:59.417 --> 16:01.794
I didn't care about anything else.
I just wanted to beat her.

16:01.878 --> 16:03.754
I thought if I just beat her, I'd be set.

16:03.838 --> 16:06.549
I've probably watched Sonagi
more than anyone.

16:06.632 --> 16:09.051
I turned it on as soon as
I woke up in the morning.

16:09.135 --> 16:10.386
But one day,

16:11.262 --> 16:13.764
she got into some sort of accident.

16:13.848 --> 16:15.892
She took about six months off

16:15.975 --> 16:18.102
and came back
a completely different person.

16:18.186 --> 16:21.022
She wasn't the Shin Seo-ri I knew.

16:21.105 --> 16:23.774
The girl who used to shine
in front of the camera.

16:29.489 --> 16:31.866
Do you know how dumbfounded I was then?

16:31.949 --> 16:34.202
My goal suddenly disappeared.

16:36.037 --> 16:39.207
Since then, I've had this weird anxiety
that just won't go away.

16:40.333 --> 16:43.503
But why are you telling me this?

16:46.797 --> 16:48.257
Just because.

16:50.510 --> 16:52.887
Maybe because you're her manager?

16:52.970 --> 16:55.556
Isn't that why you just took her side?

16:59.268 --> 17:01.354
Don't worry about the shooting schedule.

17:01.437 --> 17:02.939
I'll take care of it.

17:03.022 --> 17:04.440
What? How exactly?

17:04.524 --> 17:05.900
Well…

17:05.983 --> 17:08.110
I'll just tell them I have
a European photoshoot.

17:08.194 --> 17:11.113
If the lead says postpone,
what choice do they have?

17:11.197 --> 17:12.573
I'm off.

17:13.324 --> 17:14.283
Right.

17:18.955 --> 17:20.873
-Hold this for a second.
-Sure.

17:21.582 --> 17:22.833
Wait, what are you doing…

17:25.503 --> 17:27.838
Get well soon, my friend.

17:29.924 --> 17:31.092
Wow.

17:31.175 --> 17:33.636
Also, keep what I just told you
a secret from Shin Seo-ri.

17:33.719 --> 17:35.972
I'll sue you if you tell her.
You can bet on it.

17:42.853 --> 17:43.854
I'm off.

17:48.025 --> 17:51.445
Wow, how can she just switch
between hot and cold like that?

18:05.918 --> 18:08.212
This place is undoubtedly Joseon.

18:08.296 --> 18:10.047
Then what was that place?

18:10.131 --> 18:13.467
Was all of that truly just a dream?

18:13.551 --> 18:15.261
How could it all…

18:16.637 --> 18:18.681
have just been a dream?

18:19.599 --> 18:21.976
Seo-ri. Wake up, Seo-ri.

18:25.021 --> 18:26.397
Who was that?

18:26.480 --> 18:28.482
Someone definitely called my name.

18:49.086 --> 18:50.838
Did you know?

18:50.921 --> 18:53.341
Even after Your Highness left,

18:53.424 --> 18:55.801
the red comet burns on.
Day and night, unwavering.

18:55.885 --> 18:58.137
Quite farcical, really.
They called it an ill-omened star

18:58.220 --> 19:00.973
threatening the Crown
and sentencing you to drink poison for it.

19:01.057 --> 19:02.308
An ill-omened star?

19:02.391 --> 19:04.810
However, that star started

19:04.894 --> 19:07.563
moving last night.

19:09.440 --> 19:11.609
Ever since Your Highness returned.

19:11.692 --> 19:14.403
"Returned"? What do you know?

19:14.487 --> 19:17.865
Life and death are intertwined
like the warp and weft.

19:17.948 --> 19:21.702
Therefore, Your Highness
can live even if you die.

19:21.786 --> 19:23.204
Whether it is here…

19:25.498 --> 19:27.041
or there.

19:34.090 --> 19:36.217
What? What are you doing?

19:49.480 --> 19:51.649
There is not much time left.

19:52.775 --> 19:55.653
When the red comet finds its place again,
and your vital energy returns,

19:55.736 --> 19:58.197
it will guide Your Highness's soul.

20:00.282 --> 20:01.909
Back to your body here.

20:02.451 --> 20:04.745
"Guide it"? What does that mean?

20:06.247 --> 20:08.165
So you must sever them.

20:11.460 --> 20:13.462
Both the bad ties and the good.

20:14.630 --> 20:16.632
Every last knotted thread of old.

20:17.800 --> 20:19.093
No.

20:19.635 --> 20:21.262
What I want is…

20:24.724 --> 20:27.727
When the red comet finds its place again,
and your vital energy returns,

20:27.810 --> 20:29.729
it will guide Your Highness's--

20:30.980 --> 20:32.022
What the…

20:32.565 --> 20:33.941
What was that?

20:35.735 --> 20:37.653
Jeez. My goodness.

20:37.737 --> 20:39.238
What just came and went?

20:40.322 --> 20:41.615
No. Absolutely not.

20:41.699 --> 20:43.117
Hold on.

20:43.200 --> 20:46.078
Begone, evil spirit.
Away with you, evil spirit.

20:49.331 --> 20:53.043
Yes, the resort will proceed
without a hitch.

20:53.711 --> 20:55.713
We'll announce
the construction schedule

20:55.796 --> 20:57.840
at the upcoming
50th anniversary celebration.

20:58.716 --> 21:00.134
Of course.

21:00.760 --> 21:02.803
I must do what I can
to help the mayor out.

21:02.887 --> 21:04.680
Yes, I'll be in touch.

21:13.606 --> 21:16.025
Send a car to Mayor Jang.

21:16.734 --> 21:17.651
Yes, sir.

21:17.735 --> 21:19.487
But you have a guest.

21:32.708 --> 21:35.377
It's been a while, President Choi.

21:36.253 --> 21:38.672
Or should I call you Chairman Choi now?

21:38.756 --> 21:40.591
What brings you here, Ms. Mo?

21:40.674 --> 21:42.968
There's something we need to discuss.

21:45.304 --> 21:47.598
How would you like
to work together with me?

21:48.265 --> 21:51.060
The Biojei shares under Kaiserman.

21:51.143 --> 21:53.062
Let Mochang buy them out.

21:55.940 --> 21:57.316
-The shares?
-Yes.

21:57.399 --> 22:01.403
I'll guarantee a substantial premium.
120% of the current market value.

22:01.487 --> 22:04.240
Naturally, the partnership we formed
around Songjin Resort

22:04.323 --> 22:07.535
will also be maintained going forward.

22:07.618 --> 22:11.497
And if you partner
with Mochang's resort chain,

22:11.580 --> 22:15.042
I can guarantee the fastest expansion
into the Southeast Asian market.

22:15.709 --> 22:16.961
But I have a condition.

22:18.337 --> 22:19.296
A condition?

22:19.380 --> 22:22.174
I'd like Mochang to take
full charge of the TF team

22:22.258 --> 22:24.218
overseeing all Songjin Resort operations.

22:33.269 --> 22:35.521
Filming postponed due
to an actor's external commitments.

22:35.604 --> 22:38.315
Just like that,
she pulled off what I couldn't.

22:38.399 --> 22:40.568
Maybe because you're her manager?

22:40.651 --> 22:42.987
Isn't that why you just took her side?

22:44.363 --> 22:45.614
Manager, my foot.

22:46.490 --> 22:48.534
Look at the mess I'm in because of you.

22:48.617 --> 22:51.036
I never wanted to be a manager.

22:52.037 --> 22:55.541
Damn it. I was really going to quit
after this month.

22:59.670 --> 23:01.547
Just look at this. See?

23:01.630 --> 23:03.090
How can I quit if you…

23:09.972 --> 23:12.558
Hey, are you awake?

23:13.142 --> 23:14.768
Are you okay?

23:16.645 --> 23:19.106
I was so worried
because you weren't waking up.

23:20.774 --> 23:21.942
You…

23:22.026 --> 23:23.110
What? What was that?

23:24.153 --> 23:25.237
Down…

23:25.321 --> 23:26.864
You must be exhausted.

23:27.656 --> 23:30.284
I'm here. Just take your time.

23:30.367 --> 23:32.328
Pipe down.

23:37.958 --> 23:40.127
SEOBU POLICE STATION

23:40.210 --> 23:43.297
These documents show
that carcinogenic substances were detected

23:43.380 --> 23:45.799
in a cosmetic product your company
had scheduled for release.

23:45.883 --> 23:49.053
Directives to secretly swap ingredients
for cheap carcinogenic materials

23:49.136 --> 23:50.930
were also found.

23:52.139 --> 23:56.101
These were submitted by a whistleblower,
along with a declaration of conscience.

24:00.898 --> 24:02.858
Can you actually tell the difference

24:02.942 --> 24:05.986
between a real whistleblower
and a troll from this, Inspector?

24:06.070 --> 24:07.988
You'd pin a hit-and-run on someone

24:08.072 --> 24:09.949
even if their car was stolen
and used for it.

24:10.032 --> 24:10.991
Are you saying

24:11.075 --> 24:13.577
that there's a spy inside your company?

24:13.661 --> 24:14.620
Is that it?

24:14.703 --> 24:18.415
Then I can summon and investigate
your close associates one by one?

24:18.499 --> 24:20.250
It's definitely not anyone in my office.

24:20.334 --> 24:23.253
Just leave them out of your summons,
inquiries, or whatever else.

24:23.337 --> 24:24.296
Are you sure?

24:24.380 --> 24:26.799
You said it yourself.
Planting something like this is nothing

24:26.882 --> 24:27.841
for an insider.

24:29.635 --> 24:31.845
People sell their conscience
for chump change nowadays.

24:31.929 --> 24:33.430
This is nothing.

24:35.724 --> 24:36.892
Exactly.

24:36.976 --> 24:40.187
I'm saying nobody would risk
their life for some chump change.

24:40.270 --> 24:41.230
Why?

24:44.483 --> 24:45.985
Because if you cross me like that,

24:46.068 --> 24:49.613
I'll make sure your family can't find work
or even plant a foot in this country

24:49.697 --> 24:51.740
for three generations.

25:04.044 --> 25:05.546
Where are you?

25:06.714 --> 25:08.590
I woke up,
and you were nowhere to be found.

25:08.674 --> 25:10.634
You should be right by my side.

25:11.176 --> 25:12.511
Where did you gallivant off to?

25:12.594 --> 25:13.846
Shin Seo-ri.

25:14.680 --> 25:15.889
Just be patient.

25:15.973 --> 25:17.224
I'm on my way.

25:17.307 --> 25:20.102
We're in the middle of an investigation.
Where do you think you're going?

25:20.185 --> 25:21.061
Inspector,

25:21.145 --> 25:23.230
I need to leave immediately.

25:23.939 --> 25:25.774
Let's call it a day for now.

25:25.858 --> 25:27.568
And let me offer you a deal.

25:48.797 --> 25:49.840
Damn it.

26:08.150 --> 26:09.026
Cha Se-gye.

26:12.196 --> 26:14.823
You are drenched in sweat.
Where have you been?

26:14.907 --> 26:15.949
You…

26:19.828 --> 26:21.663
Why are you sitting up? You're a patient.

26:21.747 --> 26:23.582
Lie down. What did the doctor say?

26:23.665 --> 26:24.750
I am perfectly fine.

26:24.833 --> 26:27.711
Then why didn't you wake up
for over a week?

26:27.795 --> 26:31.006
Were you trying to make me
have an aneurysm? Damn it.

26:34.843 --> 26:36.261
Just stay there.

26:36.345 --> 26:38.639
I'll go get the doctor,
so get a full checkup--

26:38.722 --> 26:40.307
Can you not just stay?

26:42.017 --> 26:43.977
Stay by my side.

26:48.023 --> 26:49.775
If you were so worried,

26:49.858 --> 26:52.069
you should have stayed right by my side.

26:52.152 --> 26:53.529
And not go gallivanting--

26:53.612 --> 26:55.072
No, I…

26:59.201 --> 27:00.744
Hold on. This is unfair.

27:01.537 --> 27:03.831
I was right by your side the whole time.

27:03.914 --> 27:06.834
I stepped out for just a second,
and you wake up then.

27:10.546 --> 27:12.005
Then hurry up.

27:29.898 --> 27:31.316
It finally feels real.

27:32.943 --> 27:34.903
I was afraid this was a dream too.

27:36.405 --> 27:37.823
I was so worried.

27:40.075 --> 27:42.744
That dream was so long,
and it felt so real.

27:44.413 --> 27:46.039
But you were not there.

27:47.207 --> 27:48.667
And I could not wake up.

27:50.085 --> 27:53.005
I wondered what I would do
if I were trapped there forever.

27:54.673 --> 27:56.800
I was terrified.

28:02.973 --> 28:04.308
Are you an idiot?

28:05.100 --> 28:06.185
That's not scary at all.

28:39.843 --> 28:42.387
Unbelievable. Choi Mun-do…

28:43.013 --> 28:44.890
Turns out he's one nasty piece of work.

28:44.973 --> 28:48.977
When did he win over the board
to railroad this through?

28:49.061 --> 28:52.981
I told you ages ago that he always had
a weird look in his eyes.

28:53.065 --> 28:54.816
Don't go stirring things up.

28:55.442 --> 28:59.112
We can't trust anyone right now,
not the police or the prosecutors.

28:59.196 --> 29:00.280
And you?

29:00.364 --> 29:01.990
Can I trust you?

29:02.074 --> 29:05.118
Are you suspecting me right now?
In the middle of all this?

29:05.869 --> 29:07.996
I don't have a single stake
in this with that kid.

29:08.080 --> 29:09.248
You never know.

29:09.331 --> 29:11.416
You've always been shady.

29:11.500 --> 29:14.294
You suck up to Father,
all while plotting to stab me in the back.

29:14.378 --> 29:15.963
What about you?

29:17.798 --> 29:19.841
You told me
you were getting Father a watch,

29:19.925 --> 29:22.261
then secretly went
and bought him a villa in Cancun.

29:22.344 --> 29:23.428
Didn't you?

29:23.512 --> 29:26.223
Why are you bringing that up now?

29:26.306 --> 29:27.474
You're years younger than me,

29:27.557 --> 29:29.601
yet you never miss a chance
to get in my face.

29:29.685 --> 29:31.186
Please lower your voices.

29:31.270 --> 29:32.604
They're ringing down the halls.

29:32.688 --> 29:34.815
What the hell?
What are you doing here?

29:34.898 --> 29:35.983
What the…

29:36.066 --> 29:37.401
Am I not allowed to be here?

29:37.484 --> 29:39.111
I came to inspect a subsidiary.

29:39.194 --> 29:40.779
Have a seat, both of you.

29:41.655 --> 29:43.573
Who the hell are you to tell us to sit?

29:43.657 --> 29:46.952
I'm starting an internal audit
of Chail Food this week.

29:49.997 --> 29:52.124
The Q1 and Q2 accounting data is a mess.

29:52.207 --> 29:53.792
You should've balanced the numbers.

29:53.875 --> 29:55.836
I thought we might
as well pull the past ledgers

29:55.919 --> 29:58.088
and run a full reconciliation.
What do you say?

29:58.171 --> 29:59.381
A full reconciliation?

29:59.464 --> 30:01.675
I mean, why harp on the past?

30:01.758 --> 30:04.469
Shouldn't we be looking forward, not back?

30:04.553 --> 30:05.429
Mun-do.

30:05.512 --> 30:08.557
I promise you I'm not someone
who buckles under

30:08.640 --> 30:10.350
such unsophisticated threats.

30:15.397 --> 30:16.398
My God!

30:21.236 --> 30:24.614
I trust both of you will be
more than happy

30:24.698 --> 30:27.868
to attend Chail Group's
50th anniversary celebration.

30:27.951 --> 30:30.203
Come and be the first to congratulate me.

30:53.268 --> 30:55.520
For the first time in my life as a seer,

30:55.604 --> 30:57.522
I channeled a spirit.

30:57.606 --> 30:59.691
"There is not much time left."

30:59.775 --> 31:03.362
"When the red comet finds its place again,
and your vital energy returns,

31:03.445 --> 31:05.781
it will guide Your Highness's soul."

31:05.864 --> 31:07.199
I definitely received that message

31:07.282 --> 31:09.076
from the spirit that I channeled.

31:09.159 --> 31:12.329
And then I found out
there had been a red comet all along.

31:12.412 --> 31:15.540
They say it's been up there
for about three months now.

31:16.291 --> 31:17.584
And I believe

31:17.667 --> 31:19.294
that's exactly how long you've been here.

31:19.378 --> 31:22.923
I just feel like there might be
some sort of connection there.

31:23.006 --> 31:25.926
And that part about guiding a soul
really bothered me.

31:27.427 --> 31:29.262
There is not much time left.

31:29.346 --> 31:32.682
When the red comet finds its place again,
and your vital energy returns,

31:32.766 --> 31:34.351
it will guide Your Highness's soul.

31:35.185 --> 31:36.603
Back to your body here.

31:38.939 --> 31:40.399
What are you doing out here?

31:50.700 --> 31:52.285
You're unbelievable.

31:55.080 --> 31:57.249
Why did you come out here without a word?

31:57.332 --> 31:58.542
I looked everywhere for you.

31:58.625 --> 32:00.085
Just because.

32:00.168 --> 32:02.129
I wanted to look at the sky.

32:02.671 --> 32:04.673
It's cold. You could've
just looked out the window.

32:04.756 --> 32:05.882
Cha Se-gye.

32:06.425 --> 32:07.676
Look at that.

32:09.094 --> 32:10.929
Stars over Seoul. That's new.

32:11.012 --> 32:12.347
Air quality must be good today.

32:12.431 --> 32:13.348
That right there is

32:13.432 --> 32:15.016
the ill-omened star.

32:16.601 --> 32:18.854
The ill-omened star? Is that a thing?

32:18.937 --> 32:21.565
Even 300 years ago when I lived,

32:21.648 --> 32:24.151
a star like that was in the sky.

32:24.234 --> 32:26.570
They said it threatened the Crown.

32:26.653 --> 32:29.281
It was the star that brought
a blade to my neck.

32:29.364 --> 32:30.365
And now…

32:31.491 --> 32:33.660
there it is again.

32:37.164 --> 32:40.083
That can't be the same star.
That'd be the mightiest load of crap ever.

32:40.167 --> 32:42.335
Astrology, star signs, and all that junk.

32:42.419 --> 32:45.088
It's all just crap that preys
on hopeless people.

32:45.172 --> 32:46.214
Right.

32:47.007 --> 32:48.425
All crap.

32:51.845 --> 32:53.305
Cha Se-gye.

32:53.388 --> 32:54.431
What now?

32:54.514 --> 32:56.099
I want to eat some tofu.

32:56.183 --> 32:57.434
Tofu?

32:58.894 --> 33:00.187
All of a sudden?

33:00.270 --> 33:02.606
I told you over and over
not to get discharged,

33:02.689 --> 33:04.941
but you just completely tuned me out.

33:05.025 --> 33:06.985
Gosh, the broth is so good.

33:07.736 --> 33:10.530
Nothing beats tofu for warding off
trouble with the authorities.

33:10.614 --> 33:12.240
Here, eat up.

33:14.993 --> 33:16.119
Hold on.

33:16.870 --> 33:18.830
You knew I was at the police station?

33:18.914 --> 33:20.665
So you wanted to feed me tofu?

33:20.749 --> 33:23.502
Were I in better health,
I would perform a ritual immediately.

33:23.585 --> 33:26.505
But you would detest that,
so this is the least we could do.

33:26.588 --> 33:29.299
Eat up. Have some of this kalguksu too.

33:30.008 --> 33:30.967
Ridiculous.

33:32.219 --> 33:33.470
I don't want kalguksu.

33:33.553 --> 33:36.264
I'm sick of it. You eat up.

33:36.348 --> 33:38.850
-Sick of it?
-I ate it so much as a kid.

33:38.934 --> 33:41.728
My mom always defaulted to kalguksu.
That's all she ever bought me.

33:41.811 --> 33:43.480
She must've thought I liked it.

33:43.563 --> 33:45.232
But I was just pretending.

33:48.860 --> 33:51.780
But I remember
the last bowl I had with her.

33:52.614 --> 33:54.074
That one wasn't bad.

33:55.200 --> 33:56.409
Every now and then, I remember

33:56.493 --> 33:59.412
and go back to that place,
but it never tastes the same.

34:02.123 --> 34:04.668
Perhaps it is because you had it with her?

34:04.751 --> 34:05.710
What?

34:05.794 --> 34:08.380
No matter how dark the night is,

34:09.256 --> 34:11.258
if someone is by your side,

34:11.841 --> 34:15.011
it is a bit more bearable and less scary.

34:15.095 --> 34:16.805
That is just how it is.

34:16.888 --> 34:18.765
It is not about where you are.

34:18.848 --> 34:20.892
It is about who you are with.

34:25.647 --> 34:27.023
Is that so?

34:31.403 --> 34:32.696
You're right.

34:33.613 --> 34:36.366
I wondered why it was
going down so easily today.

34:36.449 --> 34:38.451
It was because I was with you.

34:39.452 --> 34:41.288
Eating alone really was the problem.

34:43.748 --> 34:45.584
You've always got a rebuttal
for everything.

34:45.667 --> 34:46.918
Eat up.

34:47.002 --> 34:48.753
People might mistake you for the patient.

34:48.837 --> 34:49.796
Here.

35:20.493 --> 35:22.037
What? What's wrong?

35:23.496 --> 35:24.414
What? No.

35:24.497 --> 35:26.082
It is nothing.

35:37.844 --> 35:39.095
What?

35:45.018 --> 35:47.395
I thought you were in the hospital.
What happened?

35:47.479 --> 35:48.730
I was worried about you.

35:48.813 --> 35:51.274
You must have been very busy.

35:51.358 --> 35:52.942
Your complexion looks even…

35:53.985 --> 35:54.944
Truth is,

35:55.028 --> 35:56.529
some lunatic

35:56.613 --> 35:58.698
has been smashing our lights every night.

35:58.782 --> 36:02.535
So I've been on a stakeout for days
trying to catch that bastard.

36:03.870 --> 36:05.580
If I ever catch him…

36:07.332 --> 36:09.751
I'm not going.
I refuse to leave you alone.

36:09.834 --> 36:11.670
What is wrong with you? It is pathetic.

36:11.753 --> 36:13.713
I've always been
pathetic and super clingy.

36:13.797 --> 36:15.382
I can't just leave you here all alone.

36:15.465 --> 36:17.384
So if you refuse to come with me…

36:17.467 --> 36:19.219
Wait. Hold on.

36:24.349 --> 36:26.518
-What the…
-I'm not going either.

36:26.601 --> 36:27.769
Do what you will.

37:07.434 --> 37:09.185
That bed is so cramped.

37:10.311 --> 37:12.272
It is even more cramped down here.

37:14.065 --> 37:15.984
You are as big as a mountain.

37:19.529 --> 37:21.698
It hurts to sleep on the floor.

37:23.491 --> 37:25.034
You're so damn stubborn.

37:33.626 --> 37:36.254
They say it's been up there
for about three months now.

37:36.337 --> 37:38.798
And I believe
that's exactly how long you've been here.

37:38.882 --> 37:41.634
When the red comet finds its place again,
and your vital energy returns,

37:41.718 --> 37:44.262
it will guide Your Highness's soul.

37:45.472 --> 37:47.974
Back to your body here.

37:48.057 --> 37:50.477
After all, you were dragged here
without warning.

37:50.560 --> 37:52.228
You could be dragged out the same way.

37:52.312 --> 37:54.689
With all that necromancy business
guiding your soul.

38:09.120 --> 38:11.664
Does this mean I will truly disappear?

38:17.629 --> 38:19.672
Shin Seo-ri, are you asleep?

38:22.008 --> 38:23.218
You know,

38:23.301 --> 38:26.054
I can say this now. The truth is,

38:26.137 --> 38:27.639
I was a little scared.

38:29.891 --> 38:32.227
While I was waiting
for you at the hospital,

38:32.310 --> 38:34.103
I couldn't sleep at night,

38:34.187 --> 38:36.439
and all sorts of thoughts
ran through my mind.

38:37.524 --> 38:38.691
Like what?

38:38.775 --> 38:40.276
"What if she wakes up

38:40.360 --> 38:42.987
and pushes me away because she's scared?"

38:43.071 --> 38:46.324
"Could I let you go then?"

38:48.201 --> 38:50.495
"I hate even thinking about that."

38:53.122 --> 38:54.833
Dumb thoughts like that.

38:55.708 --> 38:57.210
You really are a fool.

38:57.710 --> 38:59.546
When I think about

39:00.922 --> 39:03.091
how my despair could spread to you

39:03.174 --> 39:04.592
if you get involved with me,

39:04.676 --> 39:06.302
I feel so sorry,

39:06.386 --> 39:08.847
and I find myself doubting I can keep you.

39:08.930 --> 39:10.348
I don't know.

39:10.431 --> 39:12.475
I'm a selfish jerk.

39:13.810 --> 39:16.229
I don't even want to imagine
letting you go.

39:34.497 --> 39:36.833
It's weird. Ever since I met you,

39:37.667 --> 39:39.919
I think I've been getting a little dumber.

39:40.003 --> 39:42.171
Things have become simpler.

39:42.255 --> 39:44.757
And everything I spent
a lifetime running after

39:44.841 --> 39:46.968
all feels worthless now.

39:55.018 --> 39:57.020
Seriously, what am I going to do?

39:57.812 --> 39:59.689
Maybe I'm broken?

40:15.788 --> 40:17.290
Are you?

40:18.625 --> 40:20.084
I guess you are.

40:21.127 --> 40:22.545
You are broken.

40:23.880 --> 40:26.049
If you are broken, you need to be fixed.

40:26.925 --> 40:28.301
How?

40:29.093 --> 40:30.553
Like this.

40:38.978 --> 40:40.396
Cha Se-gye.

40:40.480 --> 40:43.274
No matter what happens
to us in the future,

40:43.358 --> 40:45.109
just remember this one thing.

40:45.193 --> 40:46.903
That I…

40:49.113 --> 40:51.324
truly hold you in my heart.

40:51.407 --> 40:53.534
I will take that with me wherever I go.

40:53.618 --> 40:55.745
And with that one memory,

40:57.205 --> 40:59.040
I will flourish and not wither away.

41:01.417 --> 41:02.418
Promise me.

41:32.573 --> 41:33.741
Can I get some water?

41:43.751 --> 41:45.461
Hey, Ji-hyo.

41:45.545 --> 41:46.754
Here.

41:46.838 --> 41:48.214
Thanks.

41:51.467 --> 41:53.636
Who is that? An extra?

41:53.720 --> 41:56.222
But were we close enough
to drop formalities?

41:56.305 --> 41:57.598
Oh, come on.

41:57.682 --> 42:00.476
When you were the BR Ice Cream Princess,
I was the oak tree.

42:00.560 --> 42:03.187
You know that commercial
from 23 years ago.

42:03.271 --> 42:04.272
The oak tree?

42:04.355 --> 42:05.565
I see.

42:05.648 --> 42:08.609
It's been so long,
so you don't really remember.

42:08.693 --> 42:11.237
Right. That makes sense. Yeah.

42:15.992 --> 42:17.827
Did you have more to say?

42:18.828 --> 42:20.705
Well, I was wondering…

42:20.788 --> 42:22.331
Is Seo-ri doing okay?

42:23.374 --> 42:25.376
Her phone is off, and I can't reach her.

42:25.460 --> 42:27.128
You're in the same agency.

42:27.211 --> 42:29.005
I heard she regained consciousness.

42:29.088 --> 42:31.257
She didn't look that hurt anyway.

42:32.925 --> 42:34.969
Did you go visit her in the hospital?

42:36.137 --> 42:37.930
Well, we're in the same agency,

42:38.014 --> 42:39.891
so it's the least I could do.

42:39.974 --> 42:41.642
Why? Do you want her home address?

42:41.726 --> 42:44.020
No, that would be going overboard.

42:44.103 --> 42:46.105
Plenty of people
are already taking care of her.

42:46.189 --> 42:47.857
Okay. I'll be going now.

42:47.940 --> 42:49.400
You can get back to it.

42:53.571 --> 42:55.990
Hold on, what is Baek Gwang-nam doing?

42:56.074 --> 42:58.034
Is he slacking off somewhere?

42:59.160 --> 43:00.620
Manager Baek Gwang-nam!

43:00.703 --> 43:02.205
Manager Baek Gwang-nam!

43:02.997 --> 43:05.333
Manager Baek Gwang-nam! Manager Baek!

43:05.416 --> 43:06.584
Is being the lead the end-all?

43:06.667 --> 43:09.712
Who does she think she is changing up
the schedule however she wants?

43:09.796 --> 43:12.256
Thanks to her,
Shin Seo-ri was let off the hook.

43:12.882 --> 43:14.717
I heard she got into a fender bender.

43:14.801 --> 43:17.929
If it weren't for Yoon Ji-hyo,
she would've been fired a long time ago.

43:18.012 --> 43:19.222
That's true.

43:20.139 --> 43:23.935
Hold on, did Yoon Ji-hyo postpone
the schedule for Shin Seo-ri's sake?

43:24.018 --> 43:26.229
-Because they're in the same agency?
-As if.

43:26.312 --> 43:27.980
Those two are total arch-enemies.

43:28.064 --> 43:31.859
No. It's one-sided.
Yoon Ji-hyo despises Shin Seo-ri.

43:31.943 --> 43:33.027
Full-on loathing.

43:34.570 --> 43:36.239
There's no full-on loathing.

43:41.160 --> 43:42.286
Never heard of rivals?

43:42.370 --> 43:43.704
Fated counterparts.

43:43.788 --> 43:44.747
Like Ronaldo and Messi.

43:44.831 --> 43:47.166
Kang Baek-ho and Seo Tae-woong.
Lee Seung-yeop and Lee Dae-ho.

43:47.250 --> 43:48.751
-Who are you?
-Me?

43:49.794 --> 43:51.963
I'm Shin Seo-ri's manager.

43:52.046 --> 43:54.132
And Ji-hyo's day-to-day manager. Why?

43:54.215 --> 43:56.008
Let's not go throwing
people's names around

43:56.092 --> 43:58.719
when you don't know
the full story. All right?

43:58.803 --> 44:00.930
Manager Baek Gwang-nam!

44:01.931 --> 44:03.975
-Manager!
-Nice catch.

44:05.393 --> 44:07.854
-What sort of manager…
-What's with him?

44:07.937 --> 44:10.356
-You want me to just eat it?
-As if she weren't bad enough,

44:10.439 --> 44:12.942
now her manager is even acting up?

44:14.819 --> 44:18.364
Seo-ri. Wake up, Seo-ri.

44:18.447 --> 44:20.658
When you wake up from your nap,

44:20.741 --> 44:22.994
we should be home.

44:35.173 --> 44:36.424
Home…

44:37.341 --> 44:39.385
There is not much time left.

44:39.468 --> 44:43.097
When the red comet finds its place again,
and your vital energy returns,

44:43.181 --> 44:45.683
it will guide Your Highness's soul.

44:45.766 --> 44:47.935
Back to your body here.

44:50.146 --> 44:52.690
Does this mean I will truly disappear

44:53.441 --> 44:54.775
from this place?

44:55.359 --> 44:59.655
CHAIL SEOUL HOSPITAL

45:06.037 --> 45:07.914
That's why I want Se-gye

45:07.997 --> 45:09.874
to start a family of his own

45:09.957 --> 45:11.626
and never be lonely again.

45:11.709 --> 45:13.294
That's all I ask.

45:13.377 --> 45:15.755
If that is the case,
you do not need to worry.

45:15.838 --> 45:18.132
I will make sure he is never lonely again.

45:18.216 --> 45:20.259
I have thought about it long and hard.

45:20.343 --> 45:22.345
Why you kept me at a distance.

45:22.428 --> 45:24.931
Hoping Cha Se-gye would start a family…

45:27.391 --> 45:29.769
and not be lonely among other people.

45:29.852 --> 45:31.395
That must be how

45:31.479 --> 45:34.065
you have kept him safe until now.

45:34.148 --> 45:35.775
Foolishly and selfishly.

45:40.112 --> 45:42.782
I was certain it was foolish,
but in the end…

45:42.865 --> 45:44.492
Fine, it's because I'm lonely.

45:44.575 --> 45:47.745
Do not worry.
I will not let you be lonely.

45:48.663 --> 45:51.207
I will make sure you are not alone.

45:55.628 --> 45:57.546
It seems I cannot help it either.

45:57.630 --> 45:59.173
More than anyone,

45:59.257 --> 46:01.801
I do not want him to suffer.

46:02.635 --> 46:07.014
I do not wish to see him wither away,
reaching for the void the way I did.

46:07.098 --> 46:09.100
So do not worry.

46:09.976 --> 46:12.144
Your selfish wish.

46:13.729 --> 46:15.189
I shall make sure to grant it.

46:46.971 --> 46:50.433
A blood alcohol level of 0.12
is grounds for license revocation.

46:50.516 --> 46:52.601
Even if it goes straight
to the prosecutors,

46:52.685 --> 46:53.936
it'll be a suspended indictment.

46:54.020 --> 46:56.397
That's the part I find strange.

46:56.480 --> 46:58.649
It's been less than three months
since his last DUI.

46:58.733 --> 47:00.443
He's highly likely to be indicted.

47:00.526 --> 47:01.444
A lot of gambling debt.

47:01.527 --> 47:04.155
Just two weeks ago,
he was about to lose his truck,

47:04.238 --> 47:07.074
but he paid off all that debt
in one go, a few days ago.

47:07.158 --> 47:09.493
And right after that, he got drunk
and got behind the wheel.

47:09.577 --> 47:12.621
Unless he was determined
to go to prison…

47:12.705 --> 47:14.415
Could he be behind this as well?

47:17.585 --> 47:19.378
You're surprisingly calm.

47:19.462 --> 47:21.672
I've taken so many hits
that my blood's gone cold.

47:21.756 --> 47:23.841
-What about Choi Mun-do?
-It looks like he's planning

47:23.924 --> 47:25.217
to announce the resort project

47:25.301 --> 47:27.636
and cement his position publicly
at the upcoming ceremony.

47:27.720 --> 47:28.596
Also…

47:29.347 --> 47:30.431
Well…

47:31.057 --> 47:33.309
We can't reach the nurse.

47:33.392 --> 47:35.436
She doesn't seem to be at her place.

47:36.562 --> 47:39.106
Gosh, this is so nice.

47:39.690 --> 47:41.525
Oh my, look at that bird.

47:42.193 --> 47:45.196
Hey, Boksun, where are you going?

47:45.279 --> 47:47.615
Why are you going there?
Is something there?

47:50.409 --> 47:51.577
Is that a person?

47:52.912 --> 47:56.207
Please call the police! Call them! Hurry!

48:00.628 --> 48:02.004
Thank you.

48:02.838 --> 48:06.008
Hey, you just got out of the hospital.
Why are you back on set already?

48:06.092 --> 48:07.802
I cannot push it back again.

48:07.885 --> 48:09.095
What if I get fired?

48:09.178 --> 48:11.931
Who's firing who?
Do you know how much I put into that?

48:12.014 --> 48:13.641
Stop talking nonsense and hang up.

48:13.724 --> 48:15.184
See you later.

48:17.061 --> 48:19.480
Is that your boyfriend? Is he worried?

48:20.231 --> 48:22.316
He should worry about his own survival.

48:22.400 --> 48:23.818
His future is so bleak.

48:25.277 --> 48:26.278
Oh right.

48:27.279 --> 48:28.322
Want some?

48:29.490 --> 48:31.033
Walnut pastries.

48:31.826 --> 48:34.620
How sweet. Thinking of me while eating.

48:34.703 --> 48:37.081
Oh right. I heard Yoon Ji-hyo visited you.

48:37.164 --> 48:38.999
Look at you go, Shin Seo-ri.

48:39.083 --> 48:40.751
You even have a top star
looking after you.

48:40.835 --> 48:42.586
Looking after me? As if.

48:42.670 --> 48:44.880
Ms. Hong probably just pushed her
to show her face there.

48:44.964 --> 48:48.050
Still, I think you're really lucky.

48:48.676 --> 48:50.177
Schedule pushed back, job still intact.

48:50.261 --> 48:52.721
Quick recovery, right back on set.

48:53.389 --> 48:56.225
I just want to properly finish
the task I was given.

48:57.685 --> 49:00.813
It is the small courtesy I can give
to the name I borrowed.

49:02.022 --> 49:04.191
I also want to remain
steadfast until the very end.

49:04.275 --> 49:06.110
-Ms. Shin Seo-ri.
-Yes?

49:06.193 --> 49:08.904
The wardrobe team wants you
over at the prop storage.

49:08.988 --> 49:10.239
Really?

49:11.073 --> 49:13.117
Are they looking to settle the score
over the costume?

49:13.200 --> 49:14.076
Who knows?

49:14.160 --> 49:17.079
They might need to fit you
for a new costume.

49:20.916 --> 49:23.043
Hey, where is this wardrobe storage?

49:23.127 --> 49:25.463
It's right over there.

49:28.632 --> 49:30.968
Maybe they want to settle the score.

49:40.227 --> 49:43.314
CHAIL 50TH ANNIVERSARY
CELEBRATION CEREMONY

49:43.397 --> 49:46.817
First, a few words
from Chairman Choi Mun-do.

49:46.901 --> 49:52.656
CHAIL 50TH ANNIVERSARY
CELEBRATION CEREMONY

49:58.245 --> 50:00.581
Distinguished members of the Chail family.

50:00.664 --> 50:03.792
Over the past few days,
we have faced an unprecedented disaster.

50:03.876 --> 50:05.878
There was a tragic accident,

50:05.961 --> 50:09.298
and we had to face a crisis
that shook this company to its core.

50:09.381 --> 50:10.716
However, standing here today,

50:10.799 --> 50:12.760
I will confidently tell you this.

50:12.843 --> 50:14.887
From here on, our new Chail

50:14.970 --> 50:18.682
will follow the path of law,
principle, and justice.

50:18.766 --> 50:20.142
We will usher in a new era,

50:20.226 --> 50:21.852
where the blood and sweat you have shed

50:22.770 --> 50:24.438
is met with fair recognition.

50:31.153 --> 50:33.572
The project that will be
its first cornerstone…

50:40.454 --> 50:42.748
The Songjin Integrated Resort.

51:12.820 --> 51:14.113
With that,

51:14.196 --> 51:16.365
allow me to introduce you all

51:16.448 --> 51:18.701
to a partner with whom
Chail will build its future glory.

51:18.784 --> 51:22.162
Please welcome Ms. Mo Tae-hee
from Mochang with a round of applause.

51:32.172 --> 51:33.173
What's her deal?

51:33.257 --> 51:35.342
Hello, I am Mo Tae-hee.

51:35.426 --> 51:38.596
First, please allow me
to offer congratulations

51:38.679 --> 51:41.432
on your appointment
on behalf of all of us at Mochang.

51:42.349 --> 51:43.976
Going forward, Mochang Group

51:44.059 --> 51:45.894
will stand alongside Chail Group

51:45.978 --> 51:48.397
and do our best to establish ourselves

51:48.480 --> 51:51.567
as a leader in Korea
that defines the global standard.

51:51.650 --> 51:54.570
In that spirit, I would like to share

51:54.653 --> 51:57.197
the honor of this occasion
with a certain someone.

51:57.281 --> 52:00.284
I believe that if anyone can share

52:00.367 --> 52:04.288
the burden of the new Chail
with the chairman, it would be him.

52:05.497 --> 52:06.373
Please come up.

52:06.457 --> 52:08.459
-Isn't that Cha Se-gye?
-It's Cha Se-gye.

52:31.315 --> 52:32.816
Hello, everyone.

52:33.692 --> 52:35.903
I am Cha Se-gye, the newly appointed head

52:35.986 --> 52:39.573
of the TF team tasked with overseeing
the integrated resort development.

52:42.451 --> 52:44.161
It's nice to see you all.

52:47.414 --> 52:48.832
The prodigal son has returned.

52:54.797 --> 52:56.924
Unbelievable. Absolutely unbelievable.

53:13.899 --> 53:16.276
You summoned me, and you are not here?

53:37.965 --> 53:39.758
What do you think you're doing?

53:41.969 --> 53:43.679
I thought I'd give it a try too,

53:43.762 --> 53:45.389
a Trojan Horse.

53:46.181 --> 53:48.976
To catch a thief,
you have to enter their den first.

53:57.943 --> 54:00.154
Ms. Mo, I'm disappointed.

54:00.237 --> 54:02.406
I thought you were a smart businesswoman.

54:04.658 --> 54:05.993
But you're just a woman.

54:06.076 --> 54:07.786
I'm even more disappointed.

54:07.870 --> 54:11.915
I don't care much for the old approach
of chasing money by brute force.

54:18.922 --> 54:20.716
Dad.

54:21.550 --> 54:22.760
Seo-jun.

54:26.805 --> 54:28.223
Let's go.

54:36.148 --> 54:38.901
How do you feel?
Your mission was a success.

54:39.568 --> 54:42.446
I don't feel anything.
I haven't done anything yet.

54:43.489 --> 54:45.240
Still, we've planted our flag,
thanks to you.

54:45.324 --> 54:47.785
I look forward to great things,
Ms. Mo Tae-hee.

54:50.329 --> 54:51.955
Mr. Cha Se-gye.

54:55.959 --> 54:58.420
-Can I help you?
-We're going to need you to come with us.

54:58.504 --> 55:00.798
We have some questions for you
regarding a death.

55:00.881 --> 55:02.090
A death?

55:02.174 --> 55:03.467
You know Ms. An Seong-hui?

55:03.550 --> 55:05.719
She was found dead this morning.

55:05.803 --> 55:09.097
Some items belonging to you
were also discovered at her home.

55:09.181 --> 55:11.141
Trouble seems to be following you around.

55:11.225 --> 55:14.311
Your grandfather is in the hospital,
and your company was taken over.

55:15.771 --> 55:17.898
Shin Seo-ri, wake up.

55:17.981 --> 55:19.733
Wake up, Shin Seo-ri!

55:19.817 --> 55:22.277
You sure you can handle that?

55:23.946 --> 55:25.989
The questioning will have to wait.

55:26.073 --> 55:28.325
-Hey.
-Se-gye!

55:36.917 --> 55:39.878
How long are they going to make me wait?

55:40.504 --> 55:42.089
I am so sleepy.

55:47.219 --> 55:48.220
CHA SE-GYE

55:54.351 --> 55:56.687
Shin Seo-ri, where are you?
Are you still on set?

55:56.770 --> 55:57.688
What now?

55:57.771 --> 55:59.898
Are there people around?
Anyone suspicious?

56:00.482 --> 56:02.818
No one is here. I am alone. Why?

56:02.901 --> 56:04.236
Just wait there. I'm on my way.

56:04.319 --> 56:06.655
Go to your car right now.

56:06.738 --> 56:08.240
What is with the fussing?

56:08.323 --> 56:09.700
Worry about yourself--

56:17.374 --> 56:18.542
Goodness.

56:29.970 --> 56:32.264
What's taking her so long?

56:36.768 --> 56:39.187
The phone you are trying
to reach has been turned off…

56:39.271 --> 56:40.480
What the…

56:44.735 --> 56:47.070
-Excuse me.
-Yes?

56:47.613 --> 56:48.780
Is Seo-ri inside?

56:48.864 --> 56:50.532
She left after a call from her boyfriend.

56:50.616 --> 56:51.742
Really?

56:51.825 --> 56:54.995
She did this last time.
She must've sneaked off on a date again.

56:55.078 --> 56:57.956
-Thank you.
-Take care.

57:23.315 --> 57:26.193
-Good work today.
-Thank you.

57:34.534 --> 57:36.328
Wow.

57:37.287 --> 57:39.790
Parents are always the problem.

57:47.965 --> 57:51.677
Is this how they want to settle the score?

57:53.178 --> 57:54.680
Jeez.

58:02.479 --> 58:04.314
Why am I so dizzy?

58:25.752 --> 58:26.878
What's that?

58:27.421 --> 58:28.755
This?

58:28.839 --> 58:31.717
Photos of Shin Seo-ri
as a child actor, before that accident.

58:31.800 --> 58:33.552
The car accident she was in as a kid?

58:33.635 --> 58:37.472
After that, her acting was terrible,
and she hit rock bottom.

58:38.598 --> 58:40.100
Right.

58:42.269 --> 58:46.314
I had a hell of a time keeping
the press quiet back then.

58:46.398 --> 58:47.524
Why?

58:48.984 --> 58:50.527
There is someone in here!

58:50.610 --> 58:52.320
There is someone in here!

58:52.404 --> 58:54.406
Someone, please open the door!

58:54.489 --> 58:57.743
There is someone in here!

58:58.660 --> 58:59.828
Please open the door!

59:00.328 --> 59:02.080
There is someone in here!

59:09.087 --> 59:10.464
Help!

59:10.547 --> 59:12.758
Is anyone out there?

59:12.841 --> 59:14.968
Someone is in here!

59:16.887 --> 59:18.055
Seo-ri.

59:18.138 --> 59:19.765
Seo-ri, wake up.

59:19.848 --> 59:21.058
Take this and go to sleep.

59:21.141 --> 59:23.727
It wasn't actually a car accident.

59:23.810 --> 59:26.354
They were always taking advances
on her appearance fees.

59:26.438 --> 59:28.482
Apparently, they ran some business
into the ground.

59:28.565 --> 59:30.108
You're basically telling us to die here.

59:30.192 --> 59:33.153
When you wake up from your nap,
we should be home.

01:00:03.141 --> 01:00:04.434
Mom!

01:00:06.144 --> 01:00:08.897
The child breadwinner image
was acceptable,

01:00:08.980 --> 01:00:10.941
but a family suicide

01:00:11.024 --> 01:00:13.151
is just too dark.

01:00:13.735 --> 01:00:16.321
She was still
the Nation's Little Sister, after all.

01:00:17.531 --> 01:00:19.116
Help!

01:00:19.199 --> 01:00:21.159
Is anyone out there?

01:00:21.243 --> 01:00:22.869
Someone is in here!

01:00:24.412 --> 01:00:25.497
Dad!

01:00:25.580 --> 01:00:26.998
Mom!

01:00:39.386 --> 01:00:40.971
Help…

01:01:06.079 --> 01:01:07.497
Shin Seo-ri.

01:01:09.291 --> 01:01:11.293
Shin Seo-ri, wake up.

01:01:11.376 --> 01:01:13.003
Shin Seo-ri.

01:01:13.503 --> 01:01:14.588
Shin Seo-ri!

01:01:16.715 --> 01:01:18.383
I was just trapped again.

01:01:19.509 --> 01:01:20.927
I was trapped.

01:01:22.095 --> 01:01:24.264
It felt like I was dying.

01:01:28.268 --> 01:01:30.770
I know. Open your eyes. Look at me.

01:01:30.854 --> 01:01:33.356
Shin Seo-ri, look at me. Look!

01:01:33.440 --> 01:01:35.442
Shin Seo-ri, look at me. Open your eyes!

01:01:51.917 --> 01:01:53.335
You're okay.

01:01:54.461 --> 01:01:55.712
You're okay.

01:01:58.632 --> 01:01:59.966
Shin Seo-ri, look at me.

01:02:00.800 --> 01:02:01.801
I'm right here.

01:02:11.645 --> 01:02:14.105
Don't worry. Nothing happened.

01:02:16.399 --> 01:02:18.026
I'm right here.

01:02:20.237 --> 01:02:21.696
Who do you think you are?

01:02:22.405 --> 01:02:23.698
Who are you to…

01:02:25.533 --> 01:02:26.910
Protect him.

01:02:26.993 --> 01:02:28.411
I will be leaving soon anyway.

01:02:28.495 --> 01:02:30.497
Are you saying you're going to break up?

01:02:32.123 --> 01:02:34.501
Yes. You will not be able to find me.

01:02:35.835 --> 01:02:38.964
I never had much to my name to begin with,

01:02:40.090 --> 01:02:41.591
so I thought

01:02:42.133 --> 01:02:44.928
my feelings would be easy to discard.

01:02:45.011 --> 01:02:48.515
I thought it would be easy.

01:02:49.933 --> 01:02:51.810
But when you act like this…

01:02:52.978 --> 01:02:54.604
When you keep…

01:02:56.690 --> 01:02:59.401
making me want to live.

01:03:03.863 --> 01:03:05.824
What am I supposed to do?

01:03:08.076 --> 01:03:10.704
What do you want from me?

01:03:57.042 --> 01:04:00.503
MY ROYAL NEMESIS

01:04:30.825 --> 01:04:33.286
You're not going anywhere alone today.
Resistance is futile.

01:04:33.370 --> 01:04:36.122
-Your hwagyeong has been awakened?
-You were back in Joseon.

01:04:36.206 --> 01:04:37.457
My name is Kang Dan-sim.

01:04:38.083 --> 01:04:41.378
Could you keep smiling like that
even if you knew I would disappear?

01:04:41.461 --> 01:04:44.255
Because waiting without knowing the end
is just too hard.

01:04:44.339 --> 01:04:46.716
Ms. Nam Ok-sun is not doing well.

01:04:47.759 --> 01:04:49.594
I'm told the Chairman has just woken up.

01:04:49.677 --> 01:04:52.222
If you decide to choose her,
you don't have much time left.

01:04:52.305 --> 01:04:53.431
I am going back.

01:04:53.515 --> 01:04:56.267
You turned someone barely holding it
together into a lovesick moron.

01:04:56.351 --> 01:04:58.061
Damn it.

01:05:01.815 --> 01:05:03.817
Subtitle translation by Justin S. Kim
